  "title": "BrainsWay to Report First Quarter 2026 Financial Results on May 13, 2026",
  "summary": "BURLINGTON, Mass. and JERUSALEM, Israel, April 29, 2026 — BrainsWay Ltd. (NASDAQ & TASE: BWAY) (“BrainsWay” or the “Company”), a global leader in advanced noninvasive neurostimulation technologies, today announced that it will report its first quarter 2026 financial results and recent operational highlights before the open of the U.S. financial markets on Wednesday, May 13, […]",
